HANDOVER.md
# The MOST important entry here. COMPLIANCE.md states in writing that the footage
# is unlicensed and audits exactly which rules the project is currently breaking.
# Serving that at /COMPLIANCE.md hands a complainant their own case, and defeats
# the whole posture the file exists to describe. It is an internal document.
COMPLIANCE.md
